# TRMNL WiFi Configuration Portal

Custom Wifi Portal implemented for TRMNL.

## Directories

- /src - library source files
- /portal - captive web portal

## Editing web portal

`src/WifiCaptivePage.h` (the gzipped portal page) is a git-ignored build artifact.
`scripts/generate_branding.py` regenerates it from `portal/index.html` before every
PlatformIO build, applying the branding in `config.yml` / `config.local.yml`. After
editing index.html outside a build, run `python3 scripts/generate_branding.py`.

